  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Associated skill 10 ranks, Body Control sphere (Increase Mass (exceptional)).</p>\n<p>While you Increase Mass, you can choose to octuple your weight and gain the density of solid iron, with the following additional effects.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each of your speeds is reduced by 10 feet. Traps and wind treat you as an additional step larger (two steps including Increase Mass).</li>\n<li>You gain damage reduction 5/piercing or adamantine. For every 2 ranks in the associated skill you possess beyond 10, your damage reduction increases by 1.</li>\n<li>You sink 20 feet each time you end your turn in acid, water, or a similarly dense liquid.</li>\n<li>You are considered armed when making unarmed attacks, and you increase the damage die for your unarmed attacks by one step.</li>\n<li>The insight bonus granted by successfully enduring a maneuver or effect listed in Increase Mass increases to +5.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/body-control#toc56\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
